{
  "help": [
    "HOW TO EDIT THIS FILE / COMMENT MODIFIER CE FICHIER",
    "1. Only change text between quotes \"like this\". / Change seulement le texte entre guillemets.",
    "2. Do not remove commas , quotes \" or brackets { } [ ]. / Ne supprime pas les virgules, guillemets ou crochets.",
    "3. Replace TO BE TRANSLATED with the right word. / Remplace TO BE TRANSLATED par le bon mot.",
    "4. One field per language: french, english, susu, maninka, pular. To add a language, add its field to each word (and a block in ui-text.json).",
    "5. status: \"draft\" = word from Peace Corps books, not checked yet (the app shows 'À vérifier / To check'). Change it to \"confirmed\" when a speaker has checked it.",
    "6. alt = other ways to say it. note = a short explanation. Both are shown in the word table.",
    "7. Keep the special letters exactly: ɛ ɔ ɲ ɗ ɓ ñ.",
    "8. picture = a file in the pictures folder, like \"bonjour.jpg\".",
    "9. audio = a file name, like \"bonjour.mp3\". Put each recording in its language folder: audio/french/bonjour.mp3, audio/susu/bonjour.mp3.",
    "10. Easier way: open the Word table page in the app (edit.html), type there, and download the new file."
  ],
